videos.description:
Silhouette is second to none in its Roto and Masking capabilities. But handling Layers and masked Objects efficiently can become a hassle.

Join Product Specialist Christoph Zapletal as he shows you how to utilize Cryptomatte for your ML-powered Masking as well as for traditional Roto, both inside of Silhouette as well as with third-party applications that support Cryptomatte.

